[00:00.00]Endless Road - 林俊杰
[00:03.85]Written by：林俊杰
[00:07.70]编曲：吴庆隆
[00:11.56]HO
[00:24.81]The truth is tearing up my heart
[00:30.87]真相撕裂了我的心
[00:30.87]I can't recognize this place
[00:35.93]我对所在完全陌生
[00:35.93]The endless road without a stop sign
[00:42.61]没有休止符的无尽的道路 
[00:42.61]Can't even find a stranger this time
[00:50.96]此刻甚至无法找到一个不相识的过客 
[00:50.96]Why am I still holding back my tears
[00:56.20]为什么我还要强忍泪水 
[00:56.20]In this loneliness there's nothing to fear
[01:01.47]在寂寞的时候该没有什么好怕的 
[01:01.47]Every chord still seems a wonder
[01:04.52]却仍感觉到每条心弦的迷惘 
[01:04.52]How we could be together
[01:07.58]为什么我们能在一起 
[01:07.58]Every time I ask if this
[01:10.73]每次我都说要问我自己 
[01:10.73]Would be the last
[01:12.29]最后一次
[01:12.29]Why am I still talking to myself
[01:17.73]为什么我还是在自言自语 
[01:17.73]Hoping you will have the keys to my cell
[01:23.09]希望你将拥有打开我牢房的钥匙 
[01:23.09]Every song might calm the weather
[01:26.25]每一首歌都好像能驱逐阴霾 
[01:26.25]But it just draws me deeper
[01:29.35]但却只让我越陷越深
[01:29.35]How do I get out of this
[01:31.86]我该怎么挣脱
[01:31.86]I think I never will
[01:40.31]我想我永远做不到
[01:40.31]HO    
